  "wikitext": "A corporation is an entity the player is controlling. A corporation possesses [[Land]], [[:Category:Asset|Assets]] and [[:Category:Facility|Facilities]]. The corporation is run using capital. You can gain capital by building [[:Category:Facility|Facilities]] and collecting [[:Category:Asset|Assets]]. Once you have accumulated assets you can sell these assets at the market rate.",
